### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8004/health

### Get Cart (requires JWT token)
GET http://localhost:8004/cart
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Add Item to Cart
POST http://localhost:8004/cart/add
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "articleId": "article-123",
  "quantity": 2,
  "price": 29.99,
  "articleData": {
    "title": "Vintage Comic Book",
    "image": "https://example.com/image.jpg",
    "sellerId": "seller-456"
  }
}

### Update Cart Item Quantity
PUT http://localhost:8004/cart/items/ITEM_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 5
}

### Remove Item from Cart
DELETE http://localhost:8004/cart/items/ITEM_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Clear Cart
DELETE http://localhost:8004/cart/clear
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
